v1.1
- Fix: setup contained two full copies of itself, concatenated. The second copy
  sat after endScript, so it was dead code - but the two halves had diverged:
  version detection via python3 vs grep, fallback version 1.80.3 vs 1.78.3, and
  a failed download aborting with exit 1 vs letting the install continue. Only
  the first half ever ran; the duplicate is now removed. No behaviour change.

v1.0
- Initial release
- Tailscale VPN for Venus OS (RPi3 ARMv7 / RPi5 ARM64)
- Auto-detects architecture and downloads latest stable Tailscale binary
- runit service for tailscaled daemon
- Auth key + hostname configurable via /data/tailscale/tailscale.conf
